      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/he-is-not-solving-punjabs-problem-aakash-chopras-blunt-take-on-hardik-pandya-arshdeep-singh-trade-ahead-of-ipl-2027/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
