      <ul><li><a href="https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/nov/11/anthony-albanese-avoids-mention-of-fossil-fuels-in-cop-summit-speech" rel="noopener">Guardian Environment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
