       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · Times of India · 2026-11-11 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by Times of India, India Today">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>Owaisi and Azad to Form Alliance for UP Assembly Elections</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>AIMIM chief Asaduddin Owaisi and Azad Samaj Party president Chandrashekhar Azad are expected to announce a political alliance for the 2027 Uttar Pradesh assembly elections on November 12. The joint announcement in Lucknow aims to consolidate support among Dalit and minority voters, who represent approximately 41 percent of the state's electorate.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-11/owaisi-and-azad-to-form-alliance-for-up-assembly-elections.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This proposed third front seeks to operate independently of the BJP-led NDA and the Samajwadi Party-Congress coalition. While specific seat-sharing details remain undisclosed, the move follows Owaisi’s failed attempt to join the INDIA bloc. The parties intend to focus their platform on farmers, youth, and marginalized communities.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Strong summary of the political alliance; accurate to the provided text and context.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source · also covered by 1 more</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/up-polls-aimims-owaisi-azad-samaj-party-kanshirams-azad-likely-to-announce-alliance-on-nov-12/articleshow/135745689.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/up-assembly-elections-2027-owaisi-chandrashekhar-azad-alliance-150-seats-3037020-2026-11-11?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>This brief was written from the original report. The same event was independently covered by the other outlets listed here.</p>
    </div>
       
