     <article class="story single" data-beat="world">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">WORLD</span> · News18 World · 2026-11-11 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Russian Ambassador to US Alexander Darchiev Dies at 66</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#world</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Russian Ambassador to the United States Alexander Darchiev passed away suddenly on November 11 at age 66. The Russian Foreign Ministry confirmed the death of the veteran diplomat, who was appointed to the Washington post in March 2025, but did not disclose the cause or his location at the time of death.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-11/russian-ambassador-to-us-alexander-darchiev-dies-at-66.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Darchiev was a seasoned expert on American affairs who previously served as the head of the Foreign Ministry’s North America Department and as ambassador to Canada. The ministry praised him as an outstanding diplomat and mentor, though no further information regarding the circumstances of his sudden demise has been provided.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate and professional summary of the diplomat's death and background.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/world/what-happened-to-alexander-darchiev-where-was-russias-us-ambassador-when-he-died-10422191.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
